Joe starts with **$50**.\n\n$$\n\\text{Money left} = 50 - 42 = 8\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{8}\n$$\n\nJoe will have **$8** left after the purchase.", "decode_seconds": 8.289985720999539, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 100, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "92fcef5164e5e2f5f0eddd08adad78eb1457e04c7fd0085a5808cecae19a39bf", "output_tokens": 315, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20517532160, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20877148160, "problem_id": "gsm8k/6315aebb3eed1425", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 8324.539120774716}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "8", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 8.324539120774716, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20877148160, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20877148160, "sampling_seed": 701039044464920206, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 315, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03326351474970579, "turn_index": 0}
